            "review_title": "Review at Quán Bụi",
            "review_text": "Freedom35545473638\n1 contribution\n0\nGood meal, nice service\nNov 2024 • Family\nThis place is good for family meals. Wide range of menu and selection. Staff is friendly and nice. Nothing is too much trouble. We enjoyed our meal.\nWritten November 9, 2024\nDanh Tran\nDear Freedom35545473638,\n\nQuán Bụi (Enriching Vietnamese Food Culture) sincerely thanks for sharing your dining experience. We are truly honored to receive such positive feedback from you. Your review holds great value for us and other diners, and we are thrilled to know that you had a wonderful meal at Quán Bụi.\n\nWe are always looking for ways to enhance our service and create a truly memorable dining experience for our customers.\n\nOnce again, Quan Bui would like to sincerely thank you and look forward to serving you better in the future. \n\nSincerely,\n\nThe Quán Bụi Team\nRead more\nWritten November 9, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
